{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "de448bbf8002cd58c569498e222c40f2a4ad0e105ff6be7280ab9cb557ad59bd", "ja": "新ユニット練習初日。それぞれ違った方法で\r\n歌をものにしてきたジュリアと静香は、互い\r\nに尊敬の念を抱く。見学に来た未来と翼に\r\n褒められ、静香はまんざらでもない様子。", "zh": "新团体第一天练习，茱莉亚与静香以各自的\n方式练熟了歌曲，并对彼此满怀敬意。\n前来观摩的未来与翼夸奖静香，\n这似乎让她挺开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3c00d46591d63d93c243aada85c063421e9e8b486c8a6e9744fab5cdc1fa38c0", "ja": "（今日はジュリアと静香による新ユニットの初練習だ。\nさっそくふたりに新曲を歌ってみてもらったが……）", "zh": "（今天是茱莉亚与静香的新团体首次练习。\n我马上就请她们试唱了新歌……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "953c78d30ee74090c9b75764ed62721bad7b0e5ca08dee9f089d8a3a2f025143", "ja": "……おお、すごいな！　ふたりとも、\n初日からバッチリ歌えてるじゃないか。", "zh": "……喔喔，好棒！才练习第一天而已，\n你们就唱得很完美啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "77e3033912eb768c540a48251c2e53af476afec7c7bb1a6375cf8f65dd18ef99", "ja": "何言ってるんですか、{$P$}。\n事前に練習してくるのは、当たり前のことです。", "zh": "你在说什么呢？{$P$}。\n我们当然有事前自己练习过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "9f1287d8a9b2534eb4837e593e1cd06dd169f3cccf86c2dbcde81e6107a12b9f", "ja": "今日のために、楽譜は完全に頭に入れてきましたから。\nピアノでも弾けるようになりましたよ？", "zh": "为了今天，我已经把乐谱全部记在脑中了。\n还能用钢琴弹出来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "2b9ae1bb08be72e1492edf6d76bf6fc4d020994a26883290fdf2ecc1a3cbad73", "ja": "へえー！　すごいじゃん。\nやっぱシズはマジメだよな。", "zh": "是喔！厉害耶。\n静，你真的很认真呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "0cd276234f0d4c2a03449c557d109f37e0a36938a1c69f959cac26ab9db533be", "ja": "あたしは細かいとこ、ノリでやっちまうから。\nそういうのマネできないんだよな。", "zh": "我遇到细节都靠气势闯过去，\n所以办不到这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "42554734bede90f7fd4ec54b7c2a03e76be5edfb7ce8d45d88c6b6a87973ac95", "ja": "えっ？　でも、ジュリアさんもさっき、\n完璧に歌えてたと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "什么？\n可是，我觉得茱莉亚刚才也唱得很完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "e9af9006b6ab0b9e1e2031ad2de2abef125f87e56334a37bd3c5deade104e7ce", "ja": "冗談！　まだまだ完璧じゃないって。ただ、せっかく\nこんなアツい歌を用意してもらったわけだし……。", "zh": "别开我玩笑了！刚才根本还不算完美。\n只是，难得有机会拿到这么热血的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "7a68361f09a52e998cc72ef84a053efe5e6dd6ade48182d6a01f2a286e9332b5", "ja": "まずはあたしの感じたまま、\nハートのままに歌ってみただけだよ。", "zh": "我只是先照自己的感觉，\n顺从内心的感受下去唱而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "76daf5d16b856644506d487a595ea4ed44980f469fdf7cab9cdd485a9f2b9b2a", "ja": "それであんなに歌えるなんて。\nやっぱりすごい……。", "zh": "这样就能唱得那么棒，\n真的好厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d1dac4c435b289e7e8bd5b3e048e5b17b64bffe046cdb1b20bc63cbcafc5863", "ja": "そういうの、きっと才能なんでしょうね。\nふふ、ちょっとうらやましいです。", "zh": "这一定就是才能吧。\n呵呵，令人有点羡慕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "0a86cefe0fe8f921e2448e0fe1ea3ec90022cb9ee99c7f9599cee3afe7b9b963", "ja": "ははっ、そんな大したものじゃないと思うぜ？\nあたしは歌が好きなだけ。", "zh": "哈哈！我觉得没那么了不起吧？\n我只是喜欢唱歌而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "cfc690aea8532fd20c084a671a5e1355c322fddf102e402ef870a37c82ebfd83", "ja": "才能っていうなら、シズみたいにマジメに努力できる\nことだって、立派な才能なんじゃないか？", "zh": "说到才能，像静能这样认真努力，\n不也是一种杰出的才能吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "ced897f9e9a8675d280850ae439e49729d183d863d9a4def74544669ae636000", "ja": "そんな。私はただ、\nやらなくちゃいけないことをやってるだけで。", "zh": "你过奖了。\n我只是把该做的事情做好罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "713f9a66ee6624c82af91231925596905a47b3a10ab0a0e3a9afced7087b1509", "ja": "話に花が咲いてるな。スケジュールの都合で、\nレコーディングまで、あまり時間がないけど……。", "zh": "你们聊得很开心呢。\n因为行程安排的关系，录音开始前几乎没有时间练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "245921eb85006ee9cb2299e36d200690ae36dfe1fcd05c96b55ebb65ac943fa9", "ja": "今のふたりなら、それも問題なさそうだ。\n安心したよ。", "zh": "但对现在的你们来说好像不是问题。\n我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "f970ea70b315b282ba5edca7d708b9aacb8dc316f431fd66537b2a3b87abeaab", "ja": "任せてください。レコーディングの日までには\nもっとよくしてみせますから！", "zh": "请交给我吧。\n正式录音那一天，我会唱得更好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b438199d48fb8595223ec41b54e7c89261929527a84d614b11c2d681f5b1c8f", "ja": "やっほー、静香ちゃ～ん！　来たよ～！", "zh": "嗨──！小静～！我们来啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0271c7de88c3764b1bcb86e77947dd769d431d458cd21af278c27acb73bfab40", "ja": "{$P$}さんと\nジュリアーノも、こんにちは～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生、\n茱莉亚诺，你们好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2b24d17b307b69771f3009efe3d60ad7b1bc980d5b88e504083083c486028f35", "ja": "おっ、なんだ。ふたりとも見学か？", "zh": "喔！怎么啦？你们来观摩的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "f31fecefca3acac2054f3284cd3dcce0600156649b6de125226940fc1bc455b2", "ja": "はい！　静香ちゃんとジュリアさん、\n今度デュオユニットになるんですよね？", "zh": "对！这次小静和茱莉亚要组成双人组团体对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7bf36bc8b2bfe8b73cc92fa6920b87c71cc959ccd83eb2dc6b8b02929d083f53", "ja": "いいな～、静香ちゃん。\nホントにジュリアーノと一緒なんだ～。", "zh": "好好喔～小静。\n你真的在跟茱莉亚诺一起练习耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "55ec7260c01ae59992fd0fca8a851b501e809e18baac38dea74ed0f436139e2a", "ja": "翼、その呼び方やめろって言ったろ？\nあたしはジュリアだ、ジュ・リ・ア！", "zh": "翼，我不是要你别这样叫我吗？\n我叫做茱莉亚，茱、莉、亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aa053cfc8a72ff29b7152134c32815cee180caba0b4c18a32ffc09c88fe57e63", "ja": "え～、可愛いじゃないですか。\nジュリアーノ♪", "zh": "为什么～明明很可爱啊？\n茱莉亚诺♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "f5dbeb7f6385aeb09f87bd812816c08d9992ef96c51d4aab6a4b516128690e5a", "ja": "はぁ。ダメだこりゃ。", "zh": "唉，我看没救了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "4e6b067801249e6652b8c0c62bf26c513261fe5c038ffa453f3cb51e94bb6a8d", "ja": "もう……。ふたりとも、練習に来ていいとは言ったけど\n騒がしくしないでね。ジュリアさんに迷惑だから。", "zh": "真是的……你们两个，我虽然同意你们来看练习，\n但可以不要吵吗？会打扰到茱莉亚的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "95bf746fb77c3b10107acaf9920f32dedfe23baf1a58f7d47ed3b196d42dda1b", "ja": "ああ、にぎやかなのは構わないぜ。しっかり見てな。\nウチらのクールなデュオをさ！", "zh": "不用介意，热闹一点没关系啊。\n好好观摩我们两个组成的酷帅双人组吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "83e251f6664f51303aca2e3d1bb84691d30ba166c7ccb09f8fb605d723471303", "ja": "わ、ホントにカッコいい！\nね、静香ちゃんたちカッコイイね、翼！", "zh": "哇！真的好帅喔！\n翼，小静她们真的好帅，对不对！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "86ae31693ec69a428ad92548bca8cc7fa0a17acce6d778b95906203c50768c62", "ja": "む～、ずるい～。ねえ{$P$}さん、\nわたしもクールなデュオ、やってみたいな～？", "zh": "唔～好羡慕喔～欸，{$P$}先生，\n人家也好想组一个帅气的双人组喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "572170040acd9e9139ce821cb79aa13edb53c719866c07df30e550c75f70632b", "ja": "あっ、じゃあ私も！\nジュリアさんとギター弾いて歌いたいです！", "zh": "啊！那我也要！\n我想和茱莉亚一起弹吉他唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0353a9283f8b2b8b4dd2db44ffc6e8e2cafa9d75c2cc816b83f5a5be6f973480", "ja": "え？　未来、ギター弾けるんだっけ？", "zh": "咦？未来，你会弹吉他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "dfeb16b9cacc17b0a89001d6473bc1d6602821e47f5328dcd6cc4468f4b1a97d", "ja": "弾いたことないけど、\n弾いたフリはけっこうトクイだよっ♪", "zh": "我是没弹过吉他，\n但是很擅长假装弹喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "acdcc396c3e7bc3c6ce1de8087520c81e70b42d29be1fc2cbe8be831c109be20", "ja": "そ、そうだな。ジュリアとのユニットは、\n今すぐにっていうのは、ちょっと難しいけど……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n你们想和茱莉亚组团，短时间内应该有点困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "952b7fbc0ca88e3fb99b88335cee9ebf4c113ae8987b746a36cdff7bcaad6dc5", "ja": "悪いな、ふたりとも。もうあたしには、\n最高の相棒がいるんでね。……な、シズ！", "zh": "抱歉啦，两位。\n我已经有个最棒的搭档了……对吧？静！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_02_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "faa7f36a88e260ef8b9724a2bbb363fa64be3f7618849bc2a390ed3bd2ea3c48", "ja": "ジュ、ジュリアさん……。", "zh": "茱、茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
